---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="제주랩스에 문의하세요.">

  <div class="contact-wrap">

    <div class="contact-hero">
      <h1>Contact</h1>
      <p>궁금한 것이 있다면 이메일로 연락해 주세요.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-body">

      <div class="contact-section">
        <h2>이메일</h2>
        <a href="mailto:contact@jejulabs.com" class="contact-email">
          contact@jejulabs.com
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-section">
        <h2>주소</h2>
        <div class="contact-address-list">
          <div class="contact-address-item">
            <span class="contact-address-label">본점</span>
            <p>제주특별자치도 서귀포시 중정로 86<br>서귀포스타트업베이 3층 302-A호</p>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-address-item">
            <span class="contact-address-label">제조소</span>
            <p>제주특별자치도 제주시 서광로 237<br>2층</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .contact-wrap {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--jl-space-2xl) var(--jl-space-lg) var(--jl-space-4xl);
  }

  .contact-hero {
    margin-bottom: var(--jl-space-2xl);
    padding-bottom: var(--jl-space-xl);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(26, 58, 42, 0.1);
  }

  .contact-hero h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--jl-text-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--jl-space-xs);
  }

  .contact-hero p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--jl-text-secondary);
  }

  .contact-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--jl-space-2xl);
  }

  .contact-section h2 {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--jl-terra);
    margin-bottom: var(--jl-space-md);
  }

  .contact-email {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--jl-text-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--jl-terra);
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    transition: color var(--jl-transition);
  }

  .contact-email:hover {
    color: var(--jl-terra);
  }

  .contact-address-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--jl-space-lg);
  }

  .contact-address-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr;
    gap: var(--jl-space-md);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .contact-address-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--jl-text-muted);
    padding-top: 3px;
  }

  .contact-address-item p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--jl-text-primary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .contact-wrap {
      padding: var(--jl-space-xl) var(--jl-space-md) var(--jl-space-2xl);
    }

    .contact-email {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }
  }
</style>
